        "original_id": "0fba4b89-3e51-5751-b594-6cfca491bb06",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Lennon, Mimi Smith, Julia Lennon\n- Works: Nowhere Boy\n- Bands: the Quarrymen, the Beatles\n\nFacts:\n- Mimi Smith was born Mary Elizabeth \"Mimi\" Smith, née Stanley, on 24 April 1906.\n- Nowhere Boy is a 2009 British biographical musical drama film.\n- Nowhere Boy depicts John Lennon's adolescence, his relationships with his aunt Mimi Smith and his mother Julia Lennon, and the creation of his first band, the Quarrymen.\n- Nowhere Boy portrays the Quarrymen's evolution into the Beatles.\n- Mimi Smith was the maternal aunt and parental guardian of the English musician John Lennon.\n- Mimi Smith died on 6 December 1991.",
